Dear {{ recipient }},

I hope this message finds you well. I am writing on behalf of AJIN Industry Co., Ltd.

{{ main_content | default("(Please describe the main purpose of this communication in 1-2 sentences.)") }}

{% if action_required %}
**Action Required**
{{ action_required }}
{% if due_date %}**Due Date**: {{ due_date }}{% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% if attachments %}
